ation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是这校园里流传的传奇</span></p><p begin="24.395" end="27.500" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.395" end="24.590">Lo</span><span begin="24.590" end="24.850">cal</span><span begin="24.850" end="25.175">ly</span> <span begin="25.175" end="25.630">fa</span><span begin="25.630" end="25.995">mous</span> <span begin="25.995" end="26.455">dra</span><span begin="26.455" end="26.795">ma</span> <span begin="26.795" end="27.500">queen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这一方天地里 你是风波的女主角</span></p><p begin="27.675" end="30.770" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.675" end="28.135">Turn</span> <span begin="28.135" end="28.775">my</span> <span begin="28.775" end="29.055">eyes</span> <span begin="29.055" end="29.295">I</span> <span begin="29.295" end="29.915">see</span> <span begin="29.915" end="30.075">you</span> <span begin="30.075" end="30.770">stare</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">目光流转 恰好撞见你的凝望</span></p><p begin="31.015" end="34.055" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.015" end="31.475">&apos;Cross</span> <span begin="31.475" end="31.655">the</span> <span begin="31.655" end="32.495">room</span> <span begin="32.495" end="32.760">and</span> <span begin="32.760" end="33.280">right</span> <span begin="33.280" end="33.555">at</span> <span begin="33.555" end="34.055">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过整个房间 直直落在我身上</span></p><p begin="34.395" end="37.655" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.395" end="34.775">Now</span> <span begin="34.775" end="35.115">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="35.115" end="35.640">smi</span><span begin="35.640" end="36.075">ling</span> <span begin="36.075" end="36.420">like</span> <span begin="36.495" end="36.855">you&apos;ve</span> <span begin="36.855" end="37.655">got</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你唇边浮起笑意 仿佛</span></p><p begin="37.725" end="41.085" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.725" e