59.635">tim</span><span begin="1:59.635" end="1:59.785">i</span><span begin="1:59.785" end="2:00.215">da</span><span begin="2:00.215" end="2:00.925">ting</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天真无邪 却又令人心慌</span></p><p begin="2:01.145" end="2:04.385" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.145" end="2:01.345">I</span> <span begin="2:01.345" end="2:01.825">still</span> <span begin="2:01.825" end="2:02.245">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="2:02.245" end="2:02.655">fi</span><span begin="2:02.655" end="2:03.145">gure</span> <span begin="2:03.145" end="2:03.400">you</span> <span begin="2:03.400" end="2:04.385">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我依然猜不透你的心</span></p><p begin="2:04.385" end="2:07.535" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.385" end="2:04.825">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:04.825" end="2:05.205">the</span> <span begin="2:05.205" end="2:05.665">kind</span> <span begin="2:05.665" end="2:05.985">that</span> <span begin="2:05.985" end="2:06.505">drives</span> <span begin="2:06.505" end="2:06.885">me</span> <span begin="2:06.885" end="2:07.535">mad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你偏偏最能让我失去分寸</span></p><p begin="2:07.925" end="2:10.785" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:07.925" end="2:08.145">Are</span> <span begin="2:08.145" end="2:08.525">you</span> <span begin="2:08.525" end="2:08.985">here</span> <span begin="2:08.985" end="2:09.335">loo</span><span begin="2:09.335" end="2:09.765">king</span> <span begin="2:09.765" end="2:10.225">for</span> <span begin="2:10.225" end="2:10.785">love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你来到这里 是想寻一份爱</span></p><p begin="2:11.195" end="2:14.420" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.195" end="2:11.435">Or</span> <span begin="2:11.435" end="2:11.675">do</span> <span begin="2:11.675" end="2:11.895">you</span> <span begin="2:11.895" end="2:12.295">love</span> <span begin="2:12.295" end="2:12.815">be</sp