28.775">a</span><span begin="2:28.775" end="2:29.015">ni</span><span begin="2:29.015" end="2:29.985">mal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我觉得 我就像一只不驯的野兽</span></p><p begin="2:30.945" end="2:35.410" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:30.945" end="2:31.230">Sha</span><span begin="2:31.230" end="2:31.900">king</span> <span begin="2:31.900" end="2:32.630">you</span> <span begin="2:32.630" end="2:33.085">are</span> <span begin="2:33.085" end="2:33.305">my</span> <span begin="2:33.305" end="2:35.410">prey</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你颤抖着 成了我的猎物</span></p><p begin="2:35.555" end="2:39.450" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.555" end="2:36.000">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="2:36.000" end="2:36.400">all</span> <span begin="2:36.400" end="2:36.915">I</span> <span begin="2:36.915" end="2:39.450">want</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而我渴望的 只有你</span></p></div><div begin="2:39.825" end="3:32.800" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:39.825" end="2:44.279" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:39.825" end="2:40.165">If</span> <span begin="2:40.165" end="2:40.655">I</span> <span begin="2:40.655" end="2:41.025">could</span> <span begin="2:41.025" end="2:41.815">go</span> <span begin="2:41.860" end="2:42.540">back</span> <span begin="2:42.540" end="2:42.680">in</span> <span begin="2:42.680" end="2:44.279">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若能沿着时光回去</span></p><p begin="2:45.740" end="2:48.071" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:45.740" end="2:45.960">I&apos;d</span> <span begin="2:45.960" end="2:46.240">shoot</span> <span begin="2:46.240" end="2:46.600">my</span> <span begin="2:46.600" end="2:48.071">shot</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我定会鼓起勇气 向你靠近</span></p><p begin="2:49.090" end="2:52.959" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:49.090" end="2:49.310">I&apos;d</span> <span begin="2:49.310" end="2:49.